#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:5
msgid "Delete title block"
msgstr "删除图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:7
msgid ""
"The title blocks templates can only be deleted from `project panel`_. "
"QElectroTech does not allow deleting templates from any menu item."
msgstr "图框模板只能从 `项目面板 <project panel_>`_ 中删除。QElectroTech不允许从任何菜单项中删除模板。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:12
msgid ""
"If the `project panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Projects**."
msgstr "如果 `项目面板 <project panel_>`_ 没有显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 项目** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:14
msgid ""
"It is important to make difference between the `project embedded "
"collection`_ and `QET`_ or `User`_ collection. The `project embedded "
"collection`_ is in the project \"database\", delete information from the "
"project does not change anything at QElectroTech or in the computer file "
"system. Deleting information from `QET`_ or `User`_ collection deletes "
"information from QElectroTech \"database\" and in the computer file system, "
"the information deleted in these \"databases\" can never be recovered."
msgstr ""
"重要的是区分 `项目嵌入式收藏 <project embedded collection_>`_ 和 `QET <QET_>`_ 或 `用户 "
"<User_>`_。`项目嵌入式收藏 <project embedded collection_>`_ "
"在项目\"数据库\"中，删除项目中的信息不会改变QElectroTech或计算机文件系统中的信息。删除来自 `QET <QET_>`_ 或 `用户 "
"<User_>`_ 收集的信息会删除QElectroTech\"数据库\"中的信息，在计算机文件系统中，这些\"数据库\"中删除的信息永远无法恢复。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:21
msgid "Delete title block from project"
msgstr "从项目中删除图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:23
msgid ""
"Right click on one title block template from `project embedded collection`_ "
"which should be deleted."
msgstr "从 `项目嵌入式收藏 <project embedded collection_>`_ 右键点击一个图框模板，应当删除。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:24
msgid ""
"Click the option **Delete this template** to delete the template form "
"project \"database\"."
msgstr "单击选项 **删除此模板** 删除模板格式项目\"数据库\"."

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:29
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:40
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Project panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech项目面板"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:32
msgid "Delete title block from collection"
msgstr "从收藏中删除图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:34
msgid ""
"Right click on the title block template from `QET`_ or `User`_ collections "
"which should be deleted."
msgstr "从 `QET <QET_>`_ 或 `User <User_>`_ 收藏中右键点击图框模板，应当删除。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:35
msgid ""
"Click the option **Delete this template** to delete the template form "
"QElectroTech and from the file system."
msgstr "单击选项 **删除此模板**,删除模板格式QElectroTech以及文件系统。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:42
msgid "Press **YES** to confirm the action."
msgstr "按 **YES** 确认动作。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:47
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech delete title block confirmation PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 删除图框确认 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_delete.rst:51
msgid ""
"The template deleted from one collection cannot be recovered, it will be "
"deleted from the QElectroTech \"database\" and from the computer file "
"system. Be sure about the operation."
msgstr "从一个收藏中删除的模板无法回收，将从 QElectroTech \"数据库\" 和计算机文件系统中删除。 请确定操作情况 。"
